);

/*
    execute the effect "fx" (number "nbr") : called by @sample, in the phase of the effect
    the output is the own cable of the effect (assigned), or Out or a bus (added)
    Mixer and Auto Mixer (the Auto Mixer only sets equal gains, see FX_Auto_Gains) :
        Out[0 ... CCnt-1] = sum of Vol_i * Src_i[Off_i ... Off_i+CCnt-1], for the sources i in [1 ... 8] not null
        the gains in dB (its_Efx_VoldB_i) are the reference : the linear gains (its_Efx_Vol_i) are computed by the check
    LFO : Out[c] = Par4 + Par3 * shape(phase + c * Par5), the phase turning at Par1 Hz
    Filter : Out = filter(Vol_1 * Src_1), cutoff Par1 (Hz) and resonance Par2 (Q), both modulated (octaves), mode Par3,
